  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that config_026 (multimodal, singleprofile, scvi_n200 RNA, resnet50 image, weighted fusion) outperforms config_001. This experiment tests whether switching the RNA encoder to scgpt (while keeping image encoder, fusion, and aggregation unchanged) improves performance. It isolates the effect of the RNA encoder, a key design choice, and builds on the promising direction of weighted fusion with resnet50. This balances exploitation (building on config_026's success) and exploration (testing a new encoder)."
}

